fura SylhetScript bekama
haraiarania "gonit.syl" hesh
bekar Main Program
shuru bekasuru
    nombor a harau 10 hesh
    boro_nombor b harau 100000 hesh
    gutaalanombor c harau 3.14 hesh
    boro_gutaalanombor d harau 3.14159 hesh
    mat naam harau "Sylhet" hesh

    foroba gullasuru a gullahesh hesh
    lekoreba gullasuru a jura_lagau 5 gullahesh hesh

    judi gullasuru a fura_boro 5 gullahesh bekasuru
        lekoreba gullasuru naam gullahesh hesh
    bekahesh

    bodlao gullasuru a gullahesh bekasuru
        dhaf 10 dui_futa
            lekoreba gullasuru "Dosh" gullahesh hesh
            domlou hesh
        shesh_mesh dui_futa
            lekoreba gullasuru "Onyo" gullahesh hesh
    bekahesh

    jotobil gullasuru a fura_chuto 12 gullahesh bekasuru
        a barau hesh
    bekahesh

    firot 0 hesh
bekahesh
shesh